<BES xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="BES.xsd">
  <Analysis>
    <Title>Sockets - Universal</Title>
    <Description><![CDATA[<P>Provides information on listening and established sockets.</P>
<P>For listening sockets the following information is provided:</P>
<OL>
<LI>Process Name
<LI>Connection Protocol (UDP/TCP)
<LI>Listening Port</LI></OL>
<P>For Established Sockets, the following information is provided:</P>
<OL>
<LI>Process Name
<LI>Connection Protocol (Always TCP)
<LI>Local Port
<LI>Remote Connection Address
<LI>Remote Port</LI></OL>
<P>For general information or to report issues with C3 Inventory content please visit GitHub here: <A href="https://github.com/strawgate/C3-Inventory">https://github.com/strawgate/C3-Inventory</A></P>]]></Description>
    <Relevance>true</Relevance>
    <Domain>BESC</Domain>
    <Property ID="1" Name="Sockets - Listening - Universal" EvaluationPeriod="PT1H">unique values of (concatenations of (it as string)) of (name of process of it | (if (windows of operating system) then &quot;SYSTEM&quot; else &quot;N\A&quot;), (if (udp of it) then (&quot;UDP&quot;) else (&quot;TCP&quot;)), local port of it) of sockets whose (udp of it or listening of tcp state of it) of network</Property>
    <Property ID="2" Name="Sockets - Established - Universal" EvaluationPeriod="PT1H">unique values of (concatenations of (it as string)) of (name of process of it | (if (windows of operating system) then &quot;SYSTEM&quot; else &quot;N\A&quot;), &quot;TCP&quot;, local port of it, remote address of it as string | &quot;none&quot;, remote port of it) of sockets whose ((established of tcp state of it and remote address of it != &quot;127.0.0.1&quot;)) of network</Property>
  </Analysis>
</BES>
